      "id": "claim_08a0555bdd924ad4b63ceea3b363fd2d",
      "statement": "All authentication logic is provided by @restheart-cloud/kit-react through the RhAuthProvider component and the useAuth() hook, which expose methods like login, register, verify, forgotPassword, resetPassword, acceptConsents, and checkSession.",
