      "id": "claim_7e0d22c4e9f343a4b1762c576ba025de",
      "statement": "The login page at /auth/login (guarded by PublicGuard) renders OAuth buttons when oauthLogin is enabled, an email/password form with inline validation, and links to signup and forgot-password. On submit it calls auth.login(email, password) and navigates to / on success, showing 'Invalid email or password' on 401.",
