      "id": "claim_8c285e5f32b1422cb0ccab402b6ad37e",
      "statement": "After OAuth provider authentication, the user is redirected back with an access token in the URL fragment (#access_token=...). The consumeFragmentToken() function in App.tsx extracts it, calls setToken() and scheduleRefresh(), then strips the fragment from the URL. It also detects ?flow=signup to set the justSignedUp flag.",
