      "statement": "When invitation.isNewUser === false, if the user is already logged in they get a one-click 'Join team' button calling auth.acceptInvite(token). If not logged in, they enter their password, which triggers auth.login() followed by auth.acceptInvite(token). On success, 'You're in' is shown and the user is redirected to / after 1.2 seconds.",
