    {
      "id": "claim_96a314a5524546d2bbe80d1e222b8899",
      "statement": "The consents gate client-side signal (src/consents-signal.ts) exports a consentsOnError callback that sets a module-level blocked flag when any API call returns HTTP 451. This callback is passed to RhAuthProvider as config.onError, enabling detection of the server-side Guards rule blocking users who haven't accepted current terms.",
      "evidence": [
