      "id": "claim_aa35109674cc4c65ad2c25c8d14a2972",
      "statement": "The justSignedUp flag is a module-level boolean in src/just-signed-up.ts. setJustSignedUp(true) is called in App.tsx when ?flow=signup is detected in the URL. Shell reads isJustSignedUp() on mount to show a welcome banner, then immediately calls setJustSignedUp(false) — a one-shot mechanism that avoids React context for a transient UI effect.",
