      "id": "claim_35214e3c03cc47cd905767d80023d5cf",
      "statement": "The rhc.setup.ts file imports the same environment object as the app and derives the server's feature toggles from it (emailRegistration maps to both registration and verification, passwordReset to password-reset, teamInvitations to invitations, oauthLogin to oauth). This ensures the flags are stated once and the server configuration stays in sync.",
